debug/
target/

# Cargo.lock is committed: this is a binary crate, reproducible builds need it.

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb
rust-proxy
.vscode
*log
temporary
.vscode
log
logs
*.html
*.profraw
.claude

# Plugin build artifacts: the component under dist/ is committed on purpose so
# `cargo test --features wasm` runs the real end-to-end test on a machine with
# no wasm32-wasip2 target. Only the per-plugin cargo target dir is ignored.
plugins/*/target/
